{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項針對OLED電視耐久性的長期測試顯示，除了消費者熟知的燒屏風險之外，部分採用LG Display面板的WOLED電視還可能面臨另一項較少被關注的問題。隨着使用時間增加，屏幕邊緣區域可能逐漸出現壞點，並呈現從邊框向內部擴散的趨勢。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585622.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:43:02.790044+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:24:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:38.487247+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:38.487247+00:00","content_hash":"81461f580f8f9138766e8362f84faf79efc7e587efdb2329e1beb4eb2a42184d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}